#: expenses/views/alternatives.py:58
msgid ""
"Walnut alternative no sms, expense tracker India without SMS permission, "
"best secure manual budgeting app India, privacy expense tracker"
msgstr ""
"Walnut का विकल्प बिना SMS, बिना SMS अनुमति के खर्च ट्रैकर भारत, सबसे "
